  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: E1_MG5_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e04fe2e0b43d5449b2134802884e59c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 21002063872
    m_Localized: That's it Lyra, we've seen all the steps involved in making a t-shirt.
      I hope you've remembered each step, because all that work goes into it... just
      for one piece of cloth!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486305566720
    m_Localized: Yes, I had no idea it would take so much time and resources. It's
      amazing! Well, can we go home now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 587568648192
    m_Localized: Not so fast! We've seen how clothes are made... but how do you think
      they get to the stores?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8958078226432
    m_Localized: Exactly! This is what we call importing. Clothes sometimes travel
      thousands of kilometers before landing in boutiques around the world. And that
      has an impact on our planet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9181852733440
    m_Localized: By the way, look, we've arrived at the clothing import center! This
      is where it all happens!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9430738538496
    m_Localized: This place is huge! So this is where all the clothes are managed
      and sent!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10142100885504
    m_Localized: Exactly! And you'll be in charge of importing his clothes all over
      the world!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10250502672384
    m_Localized: When you're ready, press the big button and I'll explain the next
      mini-game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10565801086976
    m_Localized: Take a look at the T-shirt on the bottom left of your screen, and
      click on it to find out all about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10787453276160
    m_Localized: Now that you've got all the information you need about the T-shirt,
      it's up to you to make its way to the store! You can choose between 4 means
      of transport.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11520386928640
    m_Localized: You have to choose the best option to pollute as little as possible.
      You have the right to choose several means of transport, but the more you use,
      the more you pollute, so think carefully!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11640817979392
    m_Localized: Oh! It's like a puzzle! I just have to find the right combination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11725375148032
    m_Localized: Exactly, Lyra! Do you want to do the first one together?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11855155302400
    m_Localized: All right! First, you need to find the starting and finishing points
      of your suit. See if there's a sea or ocean between them, then it's up to you
      to press the transports in the order you think is right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
